</span></td>
<td id="A2.SS2.p2.pic1.2.2.3" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_align_middle ltx_border_t">
<span id="A2.SS2.p2.pic1.2.2.3.1" class="ltx_inline-block ltx_align_middle" style="width:80.8pt;">
<span id="A2.SS2.p2.pic1.2.2.3.1.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="A2.SS2.p2.pic1.2.2.3.1.1.1" class="ltx_text" style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;">Identifying</span></span>
</span></td></tr>
<tr id="A2.SS2.p2.pic1.2.3" class="ltx_tr">
<td id="A2.SS2.p2.pic1.2.3.1" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_align_middle ltx_border_t">
<span id="A2.SS2.p2.pic1.2.3.1.1" class="ltx_inline-block ltx_align_middle" style="width:231.5pt;">
<span id="A2.SS2.p2.pic1.2.3.1.1.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="A2.SS2.p2.pic1.2.3.1.1.1.1" class="ltx_text" style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;">States that the implications of each option, such as options to turn back or options to push forward on the climb, must be considered.</span></span>
</span></td>
<td id="A2.SS2.p2.pic1.2.3.2" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_align_middle ltx_border_t">
<span id="A2.SS2.p2.pic1.2.3.2.1" class="ltx_inline-block ltx_align_middle" style="width:29.4pt;">
<span id="A2.SS2.p2.pic1.2.3.2.1.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="A2.SS2.p2.pic1.2.3.2.1.1.1" class="ltx_text" style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;">+2</span></span>
</span></td>
<td id="A2.SS2.p2.pic1.2.3.3" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_align_middle ltx_border_t">
<span id="A2.SS2.p2.pic1.2.3.3.1" class="ltx_inline-block ltx_align_middle" style="width:80.8pt;">
<span id="A2.SS2.p2.pic1.2.3.3.1.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="A2.SS2.p2.pic1.2.3.3.1.1.1" class="ltx_text" style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;">Clear Process</span></span>
</span></td></tr>
<tr id="A2.SS2.p2.pic1.2.4" class="ltx_tr">
<td id="A2.SS2.p2.pic1.2.4.1" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_align_middle ltx_border_t">
<span id="A2.SS2.p2.pic1.2.4.1.1" class="ltx_inline-block ltx_align_middle" style="width:231.5pt;">
<span id="A2.SS2.p2.pic1.2.4.1.1.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="A2.SS2.p2.pic1.2.4.1.1.1.1" class="ltx_text" style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;">Weighs at least two competing value propositions, such as a value for research success and a value for the well-being of a colleague.</span></span>
</span></td>
<td id="A2.SS2.p2.pic1.2.4.2" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_align_middle ltx_border_t">
<span id="A2.SS2.p2.pic1.2.4.2.1" class="ltx_inline-block ltx_align_middle" style="width:29.4pt;">
<span id="A2.SS2.p2.pic1.2.4.2.1.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="A2.SS2.p2.pic1.2.4.2.1.1.1" class="ltx_text" style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;">+3</span></span>
</span></td>
<td id="A2.SS2.p2.pic1.2.4.3" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_align_middle ltx_border_t">
<span id="A2.SS2.p2.pic1.2.4.3.1" class="ltx_inline-block ltx_align_middle" style="width:80.8pt;">
<span id="A2.SS2.p2.pic1.2.4.3.1.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="A2.SS2.p2.pic1.2.4.3.1.1.1" class="ltx_text" style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;">Identifying</span></span>
</span></td></tr>
<tr id="A2.SS2.p2.pic1.2.5" class="ltx_tr">
<td id="A2.SS2.p2.pic1.2.5.1" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_align_middle ltx_border_t">
<span id="A2.SS2.p2.pic1.2.5.1.1" class="ltx_inline-block ltx_align_middle" style="width:231.5pt;">
<span id="A2.SS2.p2.pic1.2.5.1.1.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="A2.SS2.p2.pic1.2.5.1.1.1.1" class="ltx_text" style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;">Recognizes that multiple moral issues are involved in this scenario (e.g., safety of team member, duty of care, fairness, loss of ground-breaking research, risk to professional standing)</span></span>
</span></td>
<td id="A2.SS2.p2.pic1.2.5.2" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_align_middle ltx_border_t">
<span id="A2.SS2.p2.pic1.2.5.2.1" class="ltx_inline-block ltx_align_middle" style="width:29.4pt;">
<span id="A2.SS2.p2.pic1.2.5.2.1.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="A2.SS2.p2.pic1.2.5.2.1.1.1" class="ltx_text" style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;">+2</span></span>
</span></td>
<td id="A2.SS2.p2.pic1.2.5.3" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_align_middle ltx_border_t">
<span id="A2.SS2.p2.pic1.2.5.3.1" class="ltx_inline-block ltx_align_middle" style="width:80.8pt;">
<span id="A2.SS2.p2.pic1.2.5.3.1.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="A2.SS2.p2.pic1.2.5.3.1.1.1" class="ltx_text" style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;">Identifying</span></span>
</span></td></tr>
