</span></td></tr>
<tr id="A2.SS2.p2.pic1.2.11" class="ltx_tr">
<td id="A2.SS2.p2.pic1.2.11.1" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_align_middle ltx_border_t">
<span id="A2.SS2.p2.pic1.2.11.1.1" class="ltx_inline-block ltx_align_middle" style="width:231.5pt;">
<span id="A2.SS2.p2.pic1.2.11.1.1.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="A2.SS2.p2.pic1.2.11.1.1.1.1" class="ltx_text" style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;">Considers that if the team turns back then grant funding from the failed research will be in jeopardy.</span></span>
</span></td>
<td id="A2.SS2.p2.pic1.2.11.2" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_align_middle ltx_border_t">
<span id="A2.SS2.p2.pic1.2.11.2.1" class="ltx_inline-block ltx_align_middle" style="width:29.4pt;">
<span id="A2.SS2.p2.pic1.2.11.2.1.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="A2.SS2.p2.pic1.2.11.2.1.1.1" class="ltx_text" style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;">+2</span></span>
</span></td>
