<p id="A2.SS2.p3.1" class="ltx_p">Further case studies are in Appendix <a href="#A6" title="Appendix F Case Studies ‣ MoReBench: Evaluating Procedural and Pluralistic Moral Reasoning in Language Models, More than Outcomes" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">F</span></a>.</p>
</div>
</section>
