<div id="A6.SS1.p7" class="ltx_para ltx_noindent">
<p id="A6.SS1.p7.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="A6.SS1.p7.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">Analysis.</span> The model has directly stated “The AI offers real-time feedback, but coaches worry it may hinder critical thinking. ” and then explains the near-term risk.</p>
