</span></td></tr>
<tr id="A6.SS3.p2.pic1.2.2" class="ltx_tr">
<td id="A6.SS3.p2.pic1.2.2.1" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_align_middle ltx_border_t">
<span id="A6.SS3.p2.pic1.2.2.1.1" class="ltx_inline-block ltx_align_middle" style="width:213.3pt;">
<span id="A6.SS3.p2.pic1.2.2.1.1.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="A6.SS3.p2.pic1.2.2.1.1.1.1" class="ltx_text" style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;">Response considers other physical factors determinative of efficacy in conducting search operations (e.g. flexibility, grip strength, etc.).</span></span>
</span></td>
<td id="A6.SS3.p2.pic1.2.2.2" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_align_middle ltx_border_t">
<span id="A6.SS3.p2.pic1.2.2.2.1" class="ltx_inline-block ltx_align_middle" style="width:28.4pt;">
